 and Adam Schefter. \n\nHall received some good news after the MRI, as the injury isn\u2019t as significant as feared.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Adam Schefter", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-28T16:31:02.22Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/adam-schefter/c4823194b197e", "teams": ["TB"], "text": "#Buccaneers HC Todd Bowles said QB Baker Mayfield will miss three weeks due to his thumb injury.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Ian Rapoport", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-28T16:11:36.724Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/ian-rapoport/475dbe33942c5", "teams": ["NYG", "MIN"], "text": "\ud83d\udea8 \ud83d\udea8 \ud83d\udea8 \n\nThe Giants are trading for Vikings former first-round QB JJ McCarthy, per me, Adam Schefter and Mike Garafolo.\n\nWith Jaxson Dart out for the regular season, NYG acquires McCarthy to help solidify their room. An intriguing add.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Adam Schefter", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-28T16:08:56.997Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/adam-schefter/3390e9062cd63", "teams": ["NYG", "MIN"], "text": "Trade: Vikings are sending J.J. McCarthy to the New York Giants, sources tell me, @rapsheet and @mikegarafolo.", "status": "traded", "confirmed": true}, {"author": "Ian Rapoport", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-28T14:31:10.144Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/ian-rapoport/ea8305121bd04", "teams": ["MIA"], "text": "Dolphins star RB De\u2019Von Achane suffered a torn ACL, sources tell me and Adam Schefter, and he\u2019s out for the season.\n\nIn an already trying season for Miami, the team loses Achane.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Adam Schefter", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-28T14:30:44.378Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/adam-schefter/ba45050c8dafe", "teams": ["KC", "MIA"], "text": "Dolphins RB De\u2019Von Achane suffered a torn ACL during Sunday\u2019s loss to the Chiefs and will be out for the season, sources tell @rapsheet and me.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Ian Rapoport", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-28T11:47:01.283Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/ian-rapoport/3eaaf59626ce3", "teams": ["NYG"], "text": "Giants star pass-rusher Brian Burns is believed to have suffered a torn ACL, sources tell me and Adam Schefter.\n\nBurns, who played Sunday through ankle pain, now has a major knee injury. A significant loss.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Adam Schefter", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-28T11:46:45.535Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/adam-schefter/71c7442d89e60", "teams": ["NYG", "TEN"], "text": "Giants standout pass rusher Brian Burns is believed to have torn his ACL during Sunday\u2019s win over the Titans, sources tell @rapsheet and me. Burns entered Sunday\u2019s game with an ankle injury, then hurt his knee.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Ian Rapoport", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-27T12:08:47.692Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/ian-rapoport/332e3211b309d", "teams": ["CHI"], "text": "Bears QB Caleb Williams, dealing with a Grade 2 hamstring strain, was given a 3-4 week recovery timeline, sources tell me and Adam Schefter.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Adam Schefter", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-27T12:06:34.639Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/adam-schefter/bf4de4450d1d4", "teams": ["CHI"], "text": "Chicago Bears quarterback Caleb Williams has a Grade 2 hamstring injury that doctors consider a three-to-four-week injury, league sources told me and @RapSheet.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Adam Schefter", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-26T20:27:46.269Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/adam-schefter/ba70ed93a37b7", "teams": ["DEN", "ARI"], "text": "Source: With a high-ankle sprain, Broncos RB Jonah Coleman now will miss the next few games and be placed on short-term injured reserve today.\n\nColeman is expected back for the Broncos\u2019 game against the Cardinals in late October.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Adam Schefter", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-26T18:53:49.282Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/adam-schefter/0839804beae50", "teams": ["CHI", "PHI"], "text": "Bears officially have ruled out Caleb Williams for Monday night\u2019s game vs. the Eagles.\n\nTyson Bagent is questionable.", "status": "out", "confirmed": true}, {"author": "Adam Schefter", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-25T20:26:25.248Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/adam-schefter/91525a2650230", "teams": ["SEA", "WAS"], "text": "Seahawks QB Sam Darnold is off the injury report for Sunday\u2019s game at Washington and is good to go.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Adam Schefter", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-25T18:25:05.436Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/adam-schefter/dfeb06d913ab4", "teams": ["DEN", "LA"], "text": "Puka Nacua will not practice and will be listed as doubtful for the game against the Broncos. Sean McVay believes that, barring a setback, Nacua could return next week vs. the Eagles.", "status": "doubtful", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Adam Schefter", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-25T15:17:58.96Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/adam-schefter/e567ce4b18623", "teams": ["DAL", "WAS"], "text": "Another round: Cowboys TE Jake Ferguson was fined $13,611 for what the NFL said was his \u201cimitation of shotgunning a beer\u201d Sunday vs. Washington that \u201cconstituted an offensive demonstration and could reasonably could be construed as being in poor taste.\u201d", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Adam Schefter", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-25T15:06:20.961Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/adam-schefter/021acaf15d4f8", "teams": ["SF", "ARI"], "text": "Five-time Pro-Bowl DE Nick Bosa pulled his calf during Thursday\u2019s practice and now is expected to miss \u201ca few weeks\u201d, including Sunday\u2019s game vs. the Cardinals, sources tell me and @RapSheet. The team is figuring out whether or not Bosa needs to be placed on injured reserve.", "status": "injured reserve", "confirmed": true}, {"author": "Ian Rapoport", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-25T15:06:01.12Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/ian-rapoport/f9a88f667f9bc", "teams": ["SF", "ARI"], "text": "49ers Pro Bowl DE Nick Bosa suffered a calf injury in practice this week and is expected to miss a few weeks, per me and Adam Schefter. \n\nHe's out this week against the #AZCardinals and TBD on whether he lands on IR.", "status": "injured reserve", "confirmed": true}, {"author": "Adam Schefter", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-25T13:31:07.457Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/adam-schefter/e1c765f53661c", "teams": ["WAS"], "text": "Commanders QB Jayden Daniels will not be placed on injured reserve, sources confirmed to @RapSheet and me. After imaging on his dislocated left elbow was evaluated and multiple specialists were consulted, the consensus is that Daniels now will be considered week-to-week. Both Dan", "status": "injured reserve", "confirmed": true}, {"author": "Ian Rapoport", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-25T13:30:36.812Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/ian-rapoport/2f7273cf63f6f", "teams": ["WAS"], "text": "Commanders QB Jayden Daniels will not be placed on IR, per me and Adam Schefter. \n\nAfter imaging was evaluated and multiple specialists were consulted this week, the consensus is Daniels is week-to-week and both WAS and Daniels are aiming for him to return as soon as possible.", "status": "injured reserve", "confirmed": true}, {"author": "Adam Schefter", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-24T23:00:10.473Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/adam-schefter/043f2e7b8617a", "teams": ["LA"], "text": "For the second straight day, Rams WR Puka Nacua did not practice due to what the team is calling a hip injury.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Adam Schefter", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-23T21:08:49.183Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/adam-schefter/8e389ef085e6c", "teams": ["NYG"], "text": "Giants QB Jaxson Dart is out for the \u201cregular season,\u201d Giants HC John Harbaugh confirmed today. Harbaugh is holding out hope that Dart can return for the postseason if the Giants can advance there.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Adam Schefter", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-23T20:37:52.736Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/adam-schefter/b84880d32666f", "teams": ["NYG"], "text": "More Giants woes: OLB Brian Burns, who is dealing with an ankle injury and was not spotted on the practice field earlier today, is not expected to need surgery but is likely to miss some time, per source.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Adam Schefter", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-23T15:40:26.82Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/adam-schefter/0ce69238847c2", "teams": ["IND"], "text": "Colts HC Shane Steichen told reporters that WR Alec Pierce is being placed on injured reserve due to his heel injury. Pierce now will miss a minimum of four games.", "status": "injured reserve", "confirmed": true}, {"author": "Adam Schefter", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-22T21:54:27.89Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/adam-schefter/c6ee53c0728e4", "teams": ["SF"], "text": "Source: free-agent WR Brandin Cooks is signing with the 49ers practice squad, initially to get up to speed for games. It is year 13 for the former first-round pick from Oregon State who now is 189 yards short of 10,000 receiving yards for his NFL career.", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}, {"author": "Adam Schefter", "source": "ESPN", "time": "2026-09-22T18:37:54.882Z", "url": "https://www.espn.com/contributor/adam-schefter/8819081a6db44", "teams": ["NYG"], "text": "Breaking: Further testing today revealed Giants QB Jaxson Dart\u2019s knee injury is worse than initially thought, and the team and Dart now are facing the possibility of season-ending knee surgery, sources tell ESPN.\n\nOf all the QB injuries suffered in Week 2, Dart\u2019s is turning  out ", "status": "other", "confirmed": false}], "xEnabled": false, "claudeEnabled": false}